+     * page and clobbers handshake bytes. Pre-push a dummy pair standing in
+     * for the missing hardware push: a terminal RTS then consumes the
+     * dummies and the stack-lift rule exits with S exactly restored. If the
+     * RAM code exits another way with the dummies still on top (S one pair
+     * below entry), strip them so the transfer stays net-zero. */
